# Generated OpenAPI output is produced by `bun run openapi:generate`.
docs/openapi.json

# NOTE: src/generated/prisma is deliberately NOT ignored.
# The Prisma 7 client is Rust-free TypeScript, and TypedSQL generation needs a
# live database. Committing the generated output keeps `docker build` and a
# clean checkout working without a database, and CI regenerates it and fails on
# any diff, so the committed copy cannot drift.
# See docs/adr/0019-prisma-7-generated-client-and-typedsql.md.
